# Source documents. Fetched by the pipeline; they do not belong in git.
# Jordbruksverket file names contain the names of natural persons. They are
# never committed: keeping them out is far easier than scrubbing history later.
pdf/
raw/
ocr/
*.pdf

# Court rulings and correspondence received by mail. The Sundsvall ruling
# names the appellant with a full personal identity number, and every .eml
# carries addresses. What the rulings establish goes into the docs; the
# documents themselves stay outside git.
data/sundsvall/
*.eml
*.zip

# Documents delivered by authorities in response to the requests. They can
# contain personal data and arrive in any format; the committed record is
# the sha256 manifest, never the documents.
data/leveranser/

# Internal working files. They stay on disk but never in the repository:
# they describe why the project exists in career terms, how it is framed for
# different audiences, and which tooling is used. None of that belongs in a
# public research record.
CLAUDE.md
STATUS.md

# Large derived files. The full paragraph corpus is 66 MB and is regenerated
# by pipeline/08_parse_paragraphs.py; the citation graph derived from it is
# committed instead, since that is the part worth reviewing. The warehouse is
# a build artefact of pipeline/10_build_warehouse.py; its manifest, which
# describes every table and column, is committed in its place.
data/dgsante_paragraphs.jsonl
data/embeddings/
data/warehouse/
data/*.parquet
data/*.duckdb
*.pbix
# One exception: the reviewed Power BI file over the DG SANTE layer, which the
# stack declaration puts in the repository. It is committed only after the
# review in docs/POWERBI.md, and only under this one path.
!docs/antumbra.pbix

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
service-account*.json

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# dbt build output and any credentials the tool writes locally
dbt/target/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/logs/
dbt/package-lock.yml
src/antumbra.egg-info/
data/hf/
data/p12/
data/dag40/

# The annex register. Its figures are published as a gap in docs/VERIFIERAT.md,
# because the material cannot separate an annex that was held back from one that
# never existed. The rows carry a flag per county and class that no claim rests
# on, and that would be read as a claim anyway, so they stay on disk;
# pipeline/43 writes them again from the deliveries.
data/bilagor.jsonl

# Session configuration for the local preview, not project content.
.claude/
